n should  that airplane have been allowed to take  off travel industry analysts Henry Hart  uh veldt says while the cruise action  certainly saved lives investigators will  be analyzing the moments leading up to  takeoff pilots have the right by the way  to say I don't think it's safe I'm not  taking off until I'm convinced it's as  safe as it needs to be Aeromexico says  so far 64 passengers have been released  from the hospital Mexican investigators  say they have recovered both at the  airplanes black boxes the National  Transportation Safety Board has sent to  investigators to Mexico to assist their  Ministry of Transportation Alex  Manny thanks a lot of questions still  the answer
 

